<ansi fg="black-bold">.:</ansi> <ansi fg="magenta">Help for </ansi><ansi fg="yellow">Evil Eye</ansi> mutation

One of your eyes darkens to a fathomless, baleful thing that fixes on
whatever you fight.

<ansi fg="yellow">Type:</ansi>     Passive (Trickster)
<ansi fg="yellow">Rarity:</ansi>   Rare

<ansi fg="yellow">Benefits:</ansi>
  When you strike a foe, your baleful gaze fixes on them — their aim
  drifts and their guard sags under the curse

